                "text": "I learned to swim at the old YMCA right on Prospect Street in Nashua. I know firsthand the role the @NMYMCA and YMCAs across New Hampshire play in our communities.\n\nWhether it\u2019s child care, health and wellness support, or sports programs for young Granite Staters, I am proud to support the YMCA\u2019s critical mission here in New Hampshire. I will keep fighting to defend every federal dollar that makes their programming possible.",
